    "This notebook uses the standardized manifests generated by the Enhanced Multi-Rate Data Processing Pipeline for Wav2Vec2 training.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Features:\n",
    "- **Uses ASR 16kHz Manifests**: Optimized for Wav2Vec2's requirements\n",
    "- **Quality-Filtered Data**: Pre-processed and normalized audio\n",
    "- **CTC Training**: Connectionist Temporal Classification for ASR\n",
    "- **Multi-Dialect Support**: Balanced Twi dialect representation\n",
    "- **Production Ready**: Complete training to deployment pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "### Expected Performance:\n",
    "- **WER <20%**: Strong performance on Twi speech\n",
    "- **Fast Inference**: Efficient transformer architecture\n",
    "- **Multi-Speaker**: Robust across different speakers"
